<title>USA: U.S. stock index futures mixed, with S&amp;Ps up some.</title>
<headline>U.S. stock index futures mixed, with S&amp;Ps up some.</headline>
<text>
<p>May 15 - U.S. stock index futures were mixed, with S&amp;Ps trading up slightly in quiet trade. Some traders look for June S&amp;Ps to weaken this afternoon, possibly re-testing the daily low of 836.10. They said buying was unimpressive for most of the day. Support is at 832.50 and 832.00.</p>
